# This app has no server and no build-time secrets, so there is nothing to put here.
#
# Your Gemini API key is typed into the Setup screen and kept in sessionStorage
# for the current tab only. It is sent straight from your browser to Google.
#
# Do NOT add a VITE_GEMINI_KEY variable: anything prefixed with VITE_ gets
# baked into the public JS bundle and would be visible to everyone.
